SUMMARY:American Psychiatric Association Annual Meeting 2027
DESCRIPTION:The 180th annual meeting of the American Psychiatric Associat
 ion\, held in New York City with more than 400 scientific sessions and o
 ver 1\,000 posters. The presidential theme is Our Future: End Stigma\, A
 dvance Science\, Secure Parity.\n\nDeadlines\nGeneral session submission
 : 2026-09-10\nCourse submission: 2026-09-10\nPoster abstract submission:
  2026-09-10\nMental Health Innovation Zone panel submission: 2026-09-10\
 nNew Research poster submission opens: 2026-11-12\nNew Research poster s
 ubmission deadline: 2027-01-08\nRegistration cancellation deadline (full
  refund): 2027-02-11\n\nhttps://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/meeting
 s/annual-meeting
LOCATION:New York\, New York
URL:https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/meetings/annual-meeting
